<item>
<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-16T02:54:43.692Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:54:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces have launched a joint operation in Kulgam, Jammu and Kashmir, and conducted surprise night inspections of religious sites in Srinagar, arresting a person for spreading false information about the attack. In Manipur, Naga civilians were killed on the Imphal-Ukhrul highway and a Kuki woman was killed, prompting a bandh and intensified security operations that included the arrest of five militants linked to Myanmar arms supplies. The CRPF has redeployed an anti-Naxal battalion from Chhattisgarh to Manipur, and district commissioners have set up social media cells after two security personnel were killed in Kishtwar. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;e-pao.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Big News Network.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Indian Express&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Excelsior&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxNdjZnZzJNZGhMY0RZRGxjMXhCOUMzNUFJUnJXN2Y4RGNaVTVVNVk4VXZYUzJPTnBrX3JQYTU5NjZrYnZnS0ZJQWVJdXBLSGVpcVVTbnp1UmhxZ1FYU3FBYzNHQVM3bmdmdnJTcnl5dFpqMnVXTzVzcm9yOEQ0NWtZVzgyNGJEaUw4eDZkejZ2ZTVCZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir News Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQb1ZLdFlNWS16WTF0eVBLYmxqczl2VVl6cFNPa05xRlN1UDZycHRoRWpPLW9yU3VhazllOTFEclYyMVEwTXpvVXZ2TUNHRzhlUHpmZFJqaGdQY196bVpiQ1h6b1I0TmQtY09XZFhrNT